{
  "name": "envboard-frontend",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "type": "module",
  "packageManager": "pnpm@10.18.2",
  "description": "envboard 工作台前端（Vite + React 19 + HeroUI v3 + Tailwind v4）。开发期 vite dev 代理到本机 8900；构建产物 dist/ 提交入库，由 crates/web 内嵌进单二进制。",
